      explanation: "<b>Step 1:</b> Sentence 2 establishes the crossing task, and sentence 3 explains the still-water practice that shaped the narrator's expectation.<br><br><b>Step 2:</b> Sentence 1 then introduces the moving current that immediately challenges that expectation.<br><br><b>Answer:</b> 2, 3, 1",
