      explanation: "<b>Step 1:</b> Sentence 2 establishes why the narrator is at the marsh, and sentence 3 explains the preparation that created confidence.<br><br><b>Step 2:</b> Sentence 1 then introduces the fog that challenges the narrator's visually based preparation.<br><br><b>Answer:</b> 2, 3, 1",
