      explanation: "Step 1: The doorway remains square because the narrator applies and passes on a method learned at the theater.<br><br>Step 2: The tray embodies the narrator's earlier cultivation work and accompanies the current architectural plans.<br><br>Step 3: Each object therefore turns an abstract connection between past and present into visible evidence of continuing usefulness.<br><br>Answer: provides tangible evidence that earlier experience can contribute to present work.",
